      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Search finds the path s \u2192 c \u2192 t in Gf.   Room on each edge: s\u2192c = 10, c\u2192t = 3\nBottleneck = min(10, 3) = 3   \u2192   push 3 units along the whole path\nFlow network: f(s,c) 0 \u2192 3, f(c,t) 0 \u2192 3 FULL\nResidual graph: every path edge loses 3 of room; backward edges c\u2192s, t\u2192c gain 3.  Full now, so it leaves Gf: c\u2192t\nFlow value |f| = 5 + 3 = 8",
      "originalText": "Search finds the path s \u2192 c \u2192 t in Gf.   Room on each edge: s\u2192c = 10, c\u2192t = 3\nBottleneck = min(10, 3) = 3   \u2192   push 3 units along the whole path\nFlow network: f(s,c) 0 \u2192 3, f(c,t) 0 \u2192 3 FULL\nResidual graph: every path edge loses 3 of room; backward edges c\u2192s, t\u2192c gain 3.  Full now, so it leaves Gf: c\u2192t\nFlow value |f| = 5 + 3 = 8",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ch12-09-ff-step-2-n14",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    }
